    "created_at": "2025-05-07T13:05:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-05-07T13:05:09Z",
    "body": "> So the proposal here would be to add Response.prototype.hash that returns this's URL's fragment.\n\nI like this approach. Seems like it's least prone to breaking things.\nI'm interested in implementing this in Firefox if this gets adopted.",
