    "updated_at": "2025-05-09T02:37:03Z",
    "body": "Thanks, @domenic, for bringing this issue to my attention.\n\nChromium's position is as follows:\n1. We are positive about @annevk's proposal to add `Response.prototype.hash`. (See: https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/1167#issuecomment-2830134900)\n2. Unfortunately, the priority is low. This is because there seems to be a workaround available for Turbo, and there doesn't appear to be strong demand for native browser support.",
