    "updated_at": "2025-05-12T10:50:54Z",
    "body": "> Unfortunately, the priority is low. This is because there seems to be a workaround available for Turbo, and there doesn't appear to be strong demand for native browser support.\n\nIf other browsers implement/ship this feature then I think it might qualify for:\n\nhttps://github.com/Supporters-Of-Chromium-Based-Browsers/Bug-Bounty-Program",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
